# =============================================================================
# WARNING: LOCAL DEVELOPMENT — DO NOT SET THIS VARIABLE. LEAVE IT COMMENTED OUT.
# =============================================================================
# When VITE_API_BASE_URL is empty/undefined, Vite automatically proxies all
# /api/* requests to http://127.0.0.1:4000 (the local backend) via vite.config.ts.
#
# IF YOU SET THIS TO A PRODUCTION URL (e.g. onrender.com, vercel.app) WHILE
# RUNNING LOCALLY, EVERY API REQUEST WILL GO OVER THE INTERNET TO THE PROD
# BACKEND. RENDER FREE-TIER COLD STARTS TAKE 15-60+ SECONDS AFTER INACTIVITY,
# WHICH WILL CAUSE 10-50 SECOND BLACK/HANGING SCREENS ON EVERY NAVIGATION.
#
# This variable is ONLY for PRODUCTION deployments (Vercel). Uncomment and set
# it ONLY in the Vercel project's Environment Variables dashboard, NOT here.
#
# Vercel / Production only:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL="https://your-backend-app.onrender.com/api"

